Z||000005||Rodney||11-11-2000||07:37 PM||||It sounds like Julian wants to keep his Mera all or close to stock including keeping the original Mera emblems on. That is nice as few exist in the original form today. Mine is highly modified. Most today have Ferrari emblems on. A few have been returned to original lately and that is encouraging. One day an original one will be worth a lot to someone. I can see the day one goes thru one of the prestigious auto autions and brings a big price. Only 247 were built.||||reg||1
